ArmCpu 0001: sysctl kern.armcpu_upc, a user-PC sampler in the interrupt handler

While it holds a pid, each interrupt taken on a core running that process's user code records ELR_EL1, the saved LR and the
thread ID; thread_get_state only sees a running thread at its next system call.

